      "username": "ahsantareen",
      "name": "Ahsan Tareen",
      "created_at": "2025-08-04T07:28:17.453Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi</p>\n<p>Frappe Insight is awesome App to achieve this report.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/6/3/630d427cf883401c0181e947fb2216c32f26258d.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/630d427cf883401c0181e947fb2216c32f26258d\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/3/630d427cf883401c0181e947fb2216c32f26258d_2_690x339.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"e8fG3JRUr476dAYBUSHLjXARYxD\" width=\"690\" height=\"339\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/3/630d427cf883401c0181e947fb2216c32f26258d_2_690x339.jpeg, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/3/630d427cf883401c0181e947fb2216c32f26258d_2_1035x508.jpeg 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/3/630d427cf883401c0181e947fb2216c32f26258d_2_1380x678.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"DAE7E3\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1632×804 124 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>The SQL query is as following;</p>\n<p>SELECT att.employee,<br>\nemp.employee_name,<br>\nDATE_FORMAT(att.attendance_date, ‘%Y-%m’) AS<br>\nMONTH,<br>\nCOUNT(DISTINCT CASE WHEN att.status = ‘Present’ THEN att.name END) AS present_count,<br>\nCOUNT(DISTINCT CASE WHEN att.status = ‘Half Day’ THEN att.name END) AS half_day_count,<br>\nCOUNT(DISTINCT CASE WHEN att.status = ‘Work From Home’ THEN att.name END) AS wfh_count,<br>\nCOUNT(DISTINCT CASE WHEN att.status = ‘Absent’ THEN att.name END) AS absent_count,<br>\nCOUNT(DISTINCT att.name) AS total_days_marked<br>\nFROM <code>tabAttendance</code> AS att<br>\nJOIN <code>tabEmployee</code> AS emp<br>\nON att.employee = emp.name<br>\nWHERE att.attendance_date BETWEEN ‘2025-01-01’ AND ‘2025-08-31’<br>\nAND att.docstatus = 1<br>\nAND att.company = ‘EXCELLENT GENERAL TRADING’<br>\nGROUP BY att.employee,<br>\nemp.employee_name,<br>\nDATE_FORMAT(att.attendance_date, ‘%Y-%m’)<br>\nORDER BY emp.employee_name,</p>\n<pre><code>MONTH\n</code></pre>",
